<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15289" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĕf-fulgĕo</span></b> , si,
		2 (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>inf.</i> effulgĕre, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 8,
				677</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Claud. VI. Cons. Hon.
			546</span></i>), v. n., <i>to shine</i> or <i>gleam forth</i>, <i>to glitter</i>
			(not anteAug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nova lux oculis effulsit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 731</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Liv. 22, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">41, 21</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auro Ductores longe effulgent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 133</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auro (fluctus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 677</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nimbo (Pallas),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 616</span></i>
			 (Forbig. ad loc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rib. and Lad. limbo): veste nivea (sacerdos),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					3, 695</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ornatu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 13, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sol,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Sirach, 50, 7</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnis Graeciae fabulositas ex hoc primum sinu
					effulsit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. H. N. 4 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 45, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">audacia aut insignibus effulgens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					4, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sensus aliquis argută et brevi
					sententiă,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Or. 20</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 6, 5</span></i>.</div>
